<doc id="85772" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=85772" title="Harland and Wolff">
Harland and Wolff

Harland and Wolff Heavy Industries iku sawijining parusahan &lt;a href="indhustri%20abot"&gt;indhustri abot&lt;/a&gt; Irlandia Lor, sing mligi gawé &lt;a href="kapal"&gt;kapal&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="pangyasa%20lepas%20pasisir"&gt;pangyasa lepas pasisir&lt;/a&gt; lan punjeré ing &lt;a href="Belfast"&gt;Belfast&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Irlandia%20Lor"&gt;Irlandia Lor&lt;/a&gt;.
Galangan kapal iki wis yasa akèh &lt;a href="kapal"&gt;kapal&lt;/a&gt;; kalebutrio &lt;a href="RMS%20Olympic"&gt;Olympic&lt;/a&gt; duwèké &lt;a href="White%20Star%20Line"&gt;White Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="RMS%20Titanic"&gt;Titanic&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="HMHS%20Britannic"&gt;Britannic&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="HMS%20Belfast"&gt;HMS Belfast&lt;/a&gt; duwèké &lt;a href="Angkatan%20Laut%20Karajan"&gt;Angkatan Laut Karajan&lt;/a&gt;, Andes duwèké &lt;a href="Royal%20Mail%20Line"&gt;Royal Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="SS%20Southern%20Cross"&gt;Southern Cross&lt;/a&gt; duwèké &lt;a href="Shaw%2C%20Savill%20%26amp%3B%20Albion%20Line"&gt;Shaw Savill&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="SS%20Canberra"&gt;Canberra&lt;/a&gt; duwèké &lt;a href="Peninsular%20and%20Oriental%20Steam%20Navigation%20Company"&gt;P&amp;O&lt;/a&gt;. Kronik resmi parusahan, "Shipbuilders to the World" dibabar taun 1986.
Ing taun 2011, indhustri &lt;a href="tenaga%20angin%20lepas%20pasisir"&gt;tenaga angin lepas pasisir&lt;/a&gt; wis njupuk peran utama lan 75% prodhuksi parusahaan didhasaraké marang &lt;a href="%C3%A8nergi%20sing%20bisa%20dianyarak%C3%A9"&gt;ènergi sing bisa dianyaraké&lt;/a&gt; lepas pasisir.
