<doc id="86187" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=86187" title="Sukhoi">
Sukhoi

Sukhoi (&lt;a href="basa%20Ruslan"&gt;basa Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;:Сухой) ya iku badan usaha kang nggawé &lt;a href="montor%20mabur"&gt;montor mabur&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="perang"&gt;perang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="milit%C3%A8r"&gt;militèr&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;. Parusahan Sukhoi madeg diprakasai déning panjenengané &lt;a href="Pavel%20Sukhoi"&gt;Pavel Sukhoi&lt;/a&gt; minangka &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1939"&gt;1939&lt;/a&gt; kanthi nama Biro Désain Sukhoi utawa misuwur kanthi sesebutan OKB-51,jaman saiki uga misuwur kanthi nama Sukhoi Corporation. &lt;a href="Pamar%C3%A9ntah"&gt;Pamaréntah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; duwé rencana kang tumuju ing &lt;a href="merger"&gt;merger&lt;/a&gt; Sukhoi déning &lt;a href="Mikoyan"&gt;Mikoyan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ilyushin"&gt;Ilyushin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Irkut"&gt;Irkut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tupolev"&gt;Tupolev&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Yakovlev"&gt;Yakovlev&lt;/a&gt;, anggawe gegayutan minangka parusahan anyar kanthi nama &lt;a href="United%20Aircraft%20Corporation%20%28Ruslan%29"&gt;United Aircraft Corporation&lt;/a&gt;.
Montor mabur jinis Suhoi kang dilakukake déning Ruslan ing jaman saiki kaya ta &lt;a href="Sukhoi%20Su-24"&gt;Su-24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sukhoi%20Su-25"&gt;Su-25&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sukhoi%20Su-27"&gt;Su-27&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sukhoi%20Su-30"&gt;Su-30&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sukhoi%20Su-33"&gt;Su-33&lt;/a&gt;. Kanthi cacah kurang luwih 2000 montor mabur kang dikirim déning njaba Ruslan. Nagara-nagara kang ngegayutan duwé montor mabur Sukhoi kaya ta &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Rakyat%20Cina"&gt;Républik Rakyat Cina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Slowak"&gt;Slowak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hungaria"&gt;Hungaria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Syria"&gt;Syria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Aljazair"&gt;Aljazair&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kor%C3%A9a%20Lor"&gt;Koréa Lor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Vietnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Afganistan"&gt;Afganistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yemen"&gt;Yemen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mesir"&gt;Mesir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Libya"&gt;Libya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iran"&gt;Iran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Angola"&gt;Angola&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ethiopia"&gt;Ethiopia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Eritrea"&gt;Eritrea&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Républik Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Peru"&gt;Peru&lt;/a&gt;.
