<li>&lt;a href="Ilyas"&gt;Ilyas&lt;/a&gt; diutus marang &lt;a href="Bangsa%20Fenisia"&gt;Funisia&lt;/a&gt; lan Bani Israèl, ing &lt;a href="Ba%27labak"&gt;Ba'labak&lt;/a&gt; Syam.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Ilyasa"&gt;Ilyasa&lt;/a&gt; diutus marang Bani Israèl lan &lt;a href="kaum%20Amoria"&gt;kaum Amoria&lt;/a&gt; ing Panyas, Syam.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Daud"&gt;Daud&lt;/a&gt; diutus marang Bani Israèlingi Palestina.</li>
